==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|their's||obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|theires}}, attested since the 1300s. Equivalent to {{af|en|their|-s}} (compare {{m|en|-'s}}); formed by analogy to {{m|en|his}}. Displaced {{m|en|theirn}} (from Middle English {{m|enm|theiren}}, formed by analogy to {{m|en|mine}}, {{m|en|thine}}) in standard speech.<ref>{{R:Etymonline}}</ref>

